# ic12_signed_distance.lgi
# compute / signed_distance_field to a plane of triangles at z = 0.4 that
# extends past the sink in x and y. As COMPUTE.md defines it, the
# distance is to the nearest source VERTEX (not to the surface); the
# sign must be the same all along each side of the plane (which side is
# positive is reported, not judged).
# check: plane | out_ic12.inp | sdf | 0.4
read / avs / plane_tri.inp / mo_src
read / avs / src_tet.inp / mo_snk
compute / signed_distance_field / mo_snk / mo_src / sdf
dump / avs / out_ic12.inp / mo_snk
finish
